msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of "Beyond Sleeping Easy with Sorcery"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/items/spellbooks.json
msgid ""
"This self-help book is themed around the Peaceful Rest spell, famed before "
"the Cataclysm as an easy way to avoid tossing and turning.  Laudably, the "
"book seems to be mostly about eventually weaning the reader off the need to "
"cast a spell to be able to fall asleep on time."
msgstr ""

