#. ~ Description of monster "aenor"
#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/domestic.json
msgid ""
"Graceful and resembling herons but stretched to the size of a horse, the "
"aenóren (\"white-striders\" in Brocéliandean) were domesticated by the elves "
