#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"This dwarf holds the traditional dwarven weapon with none of the skill and "
"craft of the axedwarves of old.  The axehead is pitted but still looks sharp,"
" and the zombies around them ignore them as they hold it."
