#: data/mods/Magiclysm/monsters/feral_fantasy_species.json
msgid ""
"A goblin out of nightmares, with their already-reddish eyes now bloodshot and"
" staring.  Their clothes are tattered and they flex their clawed fingers "
"repeatedly as they walk among the zombies."
